<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">JL-076 · ¥19.9</div>
  <h1>JL-076 韩式炸鸡基础酱（草莓酱版）</h1>
  <div class="sub">韩式炸鸡酱 · 摆摊 ✅ 炸鸡店 ✅ 家庭 ✅</div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>低门槛</span>
    <span>高复购</span>
    <span>伴手</span>
    <span>适合搭配炸鸡</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐 ★★★★★</span>
  <span class="level-item med">新手可做</span>
  <span class="level-item med">回本快</span>
  <span class="level-item med">利润稳</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    天津有一个韩式炸鸡店，老板做的韩式甜辣酱和别人不一样——别人的甜辣酱是用番茄酱打底，他用的却是草莓酱。他说这是他一个韩国朋友教的配方，在韩国有些人家里做甜辣酱会用草莓酱代替番茄酱，因为草莓酱的甜味更自然、颜色更好看。<br><br>草莓酱版的韩式炸鸡基础酱做出来颜色是暗红色带一点点粉调，比用番茄酱做出来的颜色更柔和。味道上，草莓酱的果香和韩式辣酱的辣味融合在一起，有一种很微妙的果甜味，比番茄酱版的更清新。老板说这个酱是他的秘密武器，很多顾客都说他家的甜辣酱比别人家的好吃。<br><br><em>草莓酱版基础酱的本质是用草莓酱代替番茄酱——同样提供甜味和色泽，但草莓酱有水果的天然果酸和果香，做出来的酱味道层次更丰富。而且草莓酱的黏稠度比番茄酱高，做出来的酱体更浓稠、挂壁力更强。成本上草莓酱和番茄酱差不多，但卖相和口感都有提升。</em>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">轻资产</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">投入约250元</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">★★☆☆☆</div><div class="desc">1天学会</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">★★★★☆</div><div class="desc">60%毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">果香甜辣回头高</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价（100g/份）</span><span class="v">10元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本（批量调制）</span><span class="v">约4元/份</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单份利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">约6元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销30份日利润</span><span class="v">180元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销50份日利润</span><span class="v">300元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销80份日利润</span><span class="v">480元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>月固定开销</span><span class="v">约300元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约250元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">3天</div><div>日销30份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">2天</div><div>日销50份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">1天</div><div>日销80份</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>保存期限</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">冷藏15天，需密封</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>草莓酱品质</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">便宜的草莓酱香精味重</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>颜色变化</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">草莓酱颜色放久了变暗</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>口味预期</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">有人期待传统番茄酱味</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
        <span>不锈钢锅（小号）60元</span>
    <span>密封罐（10个）40元</span>
    <span>电子秤 30元</span>
    <span>硅胶刮刀 15元</span>
    <span>温度计 20元</span>
    <span>标签贴纸 10元</span>
    <span>一次性酱料杯 0.3元/个</span>
    <span>不锈钢打蛋器 15元</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44">
    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约250元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>1m台面</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>1天</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid">
        <span class="scene-item">炸鸡摊</span>
    <span class="scene-item">韩式餐厅</span>
    <span class="scene-item">家庭厨房</span>
    <span class="scene-item">外卖档口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">甜辣小吃</span>
    <span class="scene-item">学校周边</span>
    <span class="scene-item">美食节</span>
    <span class="scene-item">超市柜台</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">搭配销售</div>
  <div class="dpair">
        <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">草莓甜辣炸鸡</div><div class="price">15-20元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">炸鸡翅</div><div class="price">12-15元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">炸年糕</div><div class="price">8元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">水果沙拉</div><div class="price">8元/份</div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:6px">草莓酱版甜辣炸鸡比普通甜辣炸鸡更有特色，女生特别喜欢这个果甜味</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">对标项目 & 竞争优势</div>
  <div class="comp">
        <div class="comp-item"><span>传统番茄酱甜辣酱</span><span class="tag adv">果香甜辣</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">番茄酱版只有酸和甜，草莓酱版多了果香层次</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>超市甜辣酱</span><span class="tag adv">草莓配方</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">超市甜辣酱全部用番茄酱，草莓酱版是差异化卖点</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>其他水果甜辣酱</span><span class="tag adv">草莓经典</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">有人用芒果、菠萝做甜辣，草莓酱是最经典的搭配</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">销售话术</div>
  <div class="copy-box">
    「美女，尝尝我们的甜辣炸鸡？<em>用的是草莓酱调的，比普通甜辣酱好吃很多</em>。」<br>
    「你尝尝这个味道，草莓的果香和辣酱搭在一起，味道特别有层次。」<br>
    「颜色也好看，不是那种红得发黑的样子，是粉粉嫩嫩的。」<br>
    「草莓甜辣炸鸡套餐，鸡+酱+沙拉一份18块，拍照也好看。」
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">避坑指南</div>
    <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 草莓酱必须用果肉含量高的——便宜的草莓酱是用淀粉+香精+色素调的，没有真正的草莓味。选果肉含量60%以上的草莓酱，做出来的酱才有天然的果香</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 草莓酱和韩式辣酱的比例是1:2——草莓酱太多酱太甜，颜色也会偏粉不像炸鸡酱；韩式辣酱太多就会盖住草莓的果香。1:2的比例甜辣果香平衡</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 熬酱时草莓酱要在最后放——韩式辣酱需要熬煮才能释放风味，但草莓酱长时间高温加热会破坏果香。先熬韩式辣酱和糖浆，关火后再拌入草莓酱</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 加一点点盐可以提升甜味的层次感——每500克酱加2克盐，盐能提升草莓的甜味和辣酱的辣味，让味道更有立体感，不会觉得单纯的甜腻</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 草莓酱版的酱颜色偏粉偏浅——如果觉得颜色不够深，可以加5克红曲米粉调色，红曲米粉是天然色素，不影响味道还能提升酱的红色</div>
</div>

<div class="pay">
  <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
  <h3>¥19.9 解锁完整方案</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>完整配方（10倍摆摊量：精确比例）</li>
    <li>调制工艺标准（温度控制、火候技巧）</li>
    <li>商用精准配比（从1份到100份的精确配比）</li>
    <li>炸鸡搭配方案（全套出品流程）</li>
    <li>保存与包装方案（密封罐+标签+冷藏）</li>
    <li>利润算盘（三档销量都算清了）</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="price-tag">¥19.9 <small>一次付费，永久查看</small></div>
  <a class="btn" href="#wechatSection" onclick="window.parent.scrollToWechat && window.parent.scrollToWechat()">📱 加微信购买</a>
  <div class="note">付款后微信发送完整文件</div>
</div>

<div class="ftr">沧林食品 · 食品创业决策系统</div>
</div>
